# 📅 Day 5 – High-Fidelity UI Design

## 🎯 Objective
Transform low-fidelity wireframes into high-fidelity UI screens for a Food Delivery Mobile Application using Figma.

---

## ✅ Task Completed

Today, I designed the high-fidelity user interface for the Food Delivery App by improving the wireframes with colors, typography, icons, spacing, and visual hierarchy.

